+
+COMMAND: kprove audit-claim-half-up.k --definition audit-verification-kompiled --spec-module AUDIT-CLAIM-HALF-UP
+EXIT STATUS: 0
+RELEVANT OUTPUT: #Top
+
+The four split files under /audit-output/evidence reproduce the four candidate
+claims verbatim in separate modules so each target was independently executed.

