Audit complete: **CONCERNS / LEGIT**.

The proof rebuilt cleanly, all four claims independently produced `#Top`, constructor pinning passed, and meaningful body/postcondition mutations failed as expected. The concern is limited to the canonical Python implementation losing precision or overflowing for very large integers.

